<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37534" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξομμᾰτ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open the eyes of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τεως μεμυκότα καὶ τυφλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.455
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be restored to sight,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ τυφλοῦ ἐξωμμάτωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					710
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>make clear</i> or <i>plain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογωπὰ σήματα ἐξωμμάτωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					499
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bereave of eyes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				541
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
